>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/galacticrafttweaker\" rel=\"nofollow\">Galacticraft Tweaker (by MJRLegends)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biometweakercore\" rel=\"nofollow\">BiomeTweakerCore (by superckl)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chunk-animator\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chunk Animator (by Lumien231)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ivtoolkit\" rel=\"nofollow\">IvToolkit (by Ivorius)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/no-recipe-book\" rel=\"nofollow\">No Recipe Book (by Adorn)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-third-person\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Third Person (by Socolio)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/main-menu-scale\" rel=\"nofollow\">Main Menu Scale (by modmuss50)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aqua-acrobatics\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aqua Acrobatics [Forge] (by embeddedt)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mouse-tweaks\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mouse Tweaks (by YaLTeR)</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#0cf\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">ASTRALIS INFINITUM</span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/athenaeum\" rel=\"nofollow\">Athenaeum (by codetaylor)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/galaxy-space-addon-for-galacticraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">Galaxy Space [Addon for GalactiCraft] (by BlesseNtumble)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/galacticrafttweaker\" rel=\"nofollow\">Galacticraft Tweaker (by MJRLegends)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/contenttweaker\" rel=\"nofollow\">ContentTweaker (by Jaredlll08)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dropt\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dropt (b